      "writtenOn": "2022-06-01T20:57:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "what is the benefit of atomics for this case? atomic_read() is pretty much the same as if you just read an int and atomic_set() is pretty much the same as doing a write. I don\u0027t see any inc/dec operations so it\u0027s not clear why atomic.\n\nWhat is the significance of \"2\"? What does \"1\" mean?",
      "revId": "5f89a09bcc7f27d97e4f704343ef10f085b23b1e",
